<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  td, th { padding: 5px 0; text-align: left; }
  .form-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .form-group { display: flex; align-items: center; }
  .form-group label { margin-right: 10px; }
  .checkbox-group label { margin-right: 15px; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: right; font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 30px;">Hampden-Sydney College</div>
  <h1 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Employment Application</h1>

  <h2 style="font-size: 12pt; border-bottom: 1px solid black; padding-bottom: 5px; margin-top: 30px;">Applicant Information</h2>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <label>Full Name:</label><br>
      <span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <label>Date:</label><br>
      <span data-field="date">{{ date }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <label>Address:</label><br>
      <span data-field="address_street">{{ address_street }}</span>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <label>M.I.:</label><br>
      <span data-field="middle_initial">{{ middle_initial }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <label>City:</label><br>
      <span data-field="city">{{ city }}</span>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <label>State:</label><br>
      <span data-field="state">{{ state }}</span>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <label>ZIP Code:</label><br>
      <span data-field="zip_code">{{ zip_code }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <label>Phone: ( )</label><br>
      <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <label>E-mail Address:</label><br>
      <span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <label>Date Available:</label><br>
      <span data-field="date_available">{{ date_available }}</span>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <label>Position Applied for:</label><br>
      <span data-field="position_applied_for">{{ position_applied_for }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <table style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 25%; padding-bottom: 10px;">Are you a citizen of the United States?</td>
      <td style="width: 10%; text-align: center;">YES</td>
      <td style="width: 10%; text-align: center;">NO</td>
      <td style="width: 25%; padding-bottom: 10px;">Have you ever worked for Hampden-Sydney College?</td>
      <td style="width: 10%; text-align: center;">YES</td>
      <td style="width: 10%; text-align: center;">NO</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 25%; padding-bottom: 10px;">Are you 18 years or older?</td>
      <td style="width: 10%; text-align: center;">YES</td>
      <td style="width: 10%; text-align: center;">NO</td>
      <td style="width: 25%; padding-bottom: 10px;">Do you have a valid driver's license?</td>
      <td style="width: 10%; text-align: center;">YES</td>
      <td style="width: 10%; text-align: center;">NO</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p>If no, are you authorized to work in the U.S.? <span data-field="authorized_to_work_us">{{ authorized_to_work_us }}</span></p>
    <p>If yes, when? <span data-field="authorization_date">{{ authorization_date }}</span></p>
    <p>If yes, provide explanation including jurisdiction: <span data-field="license_explanation">{{ license_explanation }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p>List any friends or relatives who are current employees: <span data-field="relatives_employees">{{ relatives_employees }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <h2 style="font-size: 12pt; border-bottom: 1px solid black; padding-bottom: 5px; margin-top: 40px;">Education</h2>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="width: 30%;">High School:</div>
    <div style="width: 30%;">Address:</div>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="width: 30%;">College:</div>
    <div style="width: 30%;">Address:</div>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="width: 30%;">Other:</div>
    <div style="width: 30%;">Address:</div>
  </div>

  <table style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Did you graduate or receive GED?</td>
      <td style="width: 10%; text-align: center;">YES</td>
      <td style="width: 10%; text-align: center;">NO</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Did you graduate?</td>
      <td style="width: 10%; text-align: center;">YES</td>
      <td style="width: 10%; text-align: center;">NO</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Did you graduate?</td>
      <td style="width: 10%; text-align: center;">YES</td>
      <td style="width: 10%; text-align: center;">NO</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Degree:</td>
      <td colspan="3"></td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Degree:</td>
      <td colspan="3"></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h2 style="font-size: 12pt; border-bottom: 1px solid black; padding-bottom: 5px; margin-top: 40px;">References</h2>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <div style="width: 30%;">Full Name:</div>
    <div style="width: 30%;">Relationship:</div>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <div style="width: 30%;">Phone: ( )</div>
    <div style="width: 30%;"></div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <div style="width: 30%;">Full Name:</div>
    <div style="width: 30%;">Relationship:</div>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <div style="width: 30%;">Phone: ( )</div>
    <div style="width: 30%;"></div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <div style="width: 30%;">Full Name:</div>
    <div style="width: 30%;">Relationship:</div>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <div style="width: 30%;">Phone: ( )</div>
    <div style="width: 30%;"></div>
  </div>

  <h2 style="font-size: 12pt; border-bottom: 1px solid black; padding-bottom: 5px; margin-top: 40px;">Previous Employment</h2>

  {% for job in previous_employments %}
  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px; border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px;">
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Company:</div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">Phone: ( )</div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">Supervisor:</div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Address:</div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">Dates of Employment:</div>
      <div style="width: 30%;"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Job Title:</div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">Reason for Leaving:</div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">May we contact this employer?</div>
    </div>
    <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 30%;">Responsibilities:</td>
        <td style="width: 10%; text-align: center;">YES</td>
        <td style="width: 10%; text-align: center;">NO</td>
        <td style="width: 30%;"></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}

  <h2 style="font-size: 12pt; border-bottom: 1px solid black; padding-bottom: 5px; margin-top: 40px;">Skills</h2>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <p>Do you speak, write, or understand any foreign languages, if so what language(s)? <span data-field="foreign_languages">{{ foreign_languages }}</span></p>
    <p>Do you have any special experience, training, qualifications, or skills which you feel make you especially suited for work at Hampden-Sydney College? If so, explain in detail: <span data-field="special_skills_explanation">{{ special_skills_explanation }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <table style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 30%;">Computer Skills</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Dates Used</th>
        <th style="width: 45%;">Level of Proficiency</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for skill in computer_skills %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="computer_skills[{{ loop.index0 }}]">{{ skill.name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="computer_skills[{{ loop.index0 }}].dates_used">{{ skill.dates_used }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="computer_skills[{{ loop.index0 }}].proficiency">{{ skill.proficiency }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p>Software: <span data-field="software_list">{{ software_list }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 12pt; border-bottom: 1px solid black; padding-bottom: 5px;">Applicant's Certification and Agreement</h2>
    <p>It is the policy of Hampden-Sydney College to consider all applicants for employment based on their qualifications in light of job vacancies. Our company fully complies with all applicable laws which prohibit discrimination on the basis of race, color, sex, national origin, age, marital status, or disability.</p>
    <p>I hereby certify that the facts set forth in the above employment application are true and complete to the best of my knowledge. I understand that if employed, falsified statements on this application shall be considered sufficient cause for dismissal.</p>
    <p>You are hereby authorized to make investigation of my personal history and financial and credit record through any investigative or credit agencies or bureaus of your choice. * Note: The provision of the Fair Credit Reporting Act may be applicable if a credit report on the applicant is obtained and considered.</p>
    <p>I understand that my employment at Hampden-Sydney College shall be "employment-at-will," meaning that I have the right to terminate my employment at any time with or without cause and Hampden-Sydney College retains the same right. The only exceptions to such employment-at-will status, if any, shall be contained in a written employment agreement, signed by the President of the College.</p>
    <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Signature:</div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">Date:</div>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top: 50px;">Thank you for completing this form and for your interest in employment with us.</p>
  </div>
</div>